@@ -671,3 +671,15 @@
 ## License
 
 MIT License — see [LICENSE](LICENSE)
+
+
+### Hong Kong HSI research data
+
+Alpha Zoo accepts `hsi` in the benchmark/compare API and CLI universe options.
+It loads current Wikipedia members through the shared HK provider chain,
+records the parsed revision date and missing symbols, and discloses
+`survivorship_bias: true`. A dated full-roster fallback is explicitly degraded.
+Sector labels use the SP500 coverage threshold; synthetic VWAP is an OHLC-mean
+proxy. Current members/labels can lag official reviews and are not historical
+point-in-time membership. Inspect `meta.price_provenance` for adjustment/volume
+basis; a raw-price factor benchmark is not a validated total-return strategy.
